# shadcn/ui component ownership for tooinfinity/inertia-datatables.
#
# Enforced by CI (.github/workflows/ownership.yml) and by GitHub branch
# protection (code owner review must be required on the default branch).
# See docs/architecture/shadcn-component-ownership.md for the full policy.
#
# CODEOWNERS locations supported by GitHub: repository root, .github/, docs/.
# This file lives at .github/CODEOWNERS so it stays out of the Composer
# archive (.github/ is export-ignore'd in .gitattributes) while remaining a
# GitHub-supported location.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Package-maintained compatibility shims — PROTECTED.
#
# These shims (button, checkbox, dropdown-menu, input, select, table, skeleton)
# serve shadcn/ui UI roles and are maintained by the package, not verified
# verbatim upstream copies. They must not be modified, refactored, renamed, or
# reformatted during ordinary feature development.
#
# Intentional changes require explicit maintainer authorization and a dedicated
# maintenance PR. They are not bundled with unrelated feature work.
registry/data-table/components/ui/ @tooinfinity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated registry artifacts — PROTECTED.
#
# public/r/ (registry.json and data-table.json) are generated from the
# authoritative registry source (registry.json and registry sources) by
# `npm run registry:validate` and `npm run registry:build`.
# Never edit manually; CI fails when committed artifacts are out of date.
public/r/ @tooinfinity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Registry source of truth — editable intentionally.
#
# registry.json is the single source of truth for the shadcn registry. Changes
# must be accompanied by regenerated public/r/ artifacts in the same change.
registry.json @tooinfinity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CODEOWNERS itself — self-owned so changes to ownership rules require
# maintainer review and cannot silently transfer protected-file review.
.github/CODEOWNERS @tooinfinity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI workflows and enforcement scripts — self-protected so changes to
# ownership enforcement, authorization gates, and version checks require
# maintainer review.
.github/workflows/ @tooinfinity
scripts/ci/ @tooinfinity

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ownership policy documentation.
docs/architecture/shadcn-component-ownership.md @tooinfinity
